   "title": "2026 Inter Tourism Expo Agenda Released: Cape Coast to host tourism, trade and investment leaders",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/2026-inter-tourism-expo-agenda-released-cape-coast-to-host-tourism-trade-and-investment-leaders/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
