   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "Twelve migrants died Monday attempting to cross the Aegean Sea, including six people whose bodies were found after their boat collided with a police vessel, authorities said. A baby and four women were among six people who died off the island of Lesbos on Monday following the collision, a coast guard official told AFP. The coast guard official said that in the incident off Lesbos, “a speedboat carrying migrants collided with the port side of a police patrol vessel”.",
   "summary_zh": "当局表示，12名移民周一在试图穿越爱琴海时死亡，其中6人的尸体是在他们的船只与一艘警察船只相撞后被发现的。一名海岸警卫队官员告诉法新社，一名婴儿和四名妇女是周一在莱斯博斯岛附近碰撞事故中死亡的六人中的一部分。该海岸警卫队官员表示，在莱斯博斯岛附近的事件中，“一艘载有移民的快艇与一艘警察巡逻船的左舷相撞”。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Twelve migrants died Monday attempting to cross the Aegean Sea, including six people whose bodies were found after their boat collided with a police vessel, authorities said. A baby and four women were among six people who died off the island of Lesbos on Monday following the collision, a coast guard official told AFP. The other six dead — five men and a woman — were on a small boat that capsized off the island of Samos, the coast guard added. Another 14 people from the boat, one of them a presumed Iranian organiser, were rescued. The coast guard official said that in the incident off Lesbos, “a speedboat carrying migrants collided with the port side of a police patrol vessel”. The official said eight people were rescued. The Aegean is a much-used route for migrants crossing from Turkey and hoping to reach Europe. There have been many deaths. One person died and 25 remained missing after a boat filled with migrants sank off the island of Gavdos, near Crete in September. NEWS UPDATE: Nigerians can now earn as much as $15,000- $25,000 with premium domains. You decide if you want payment in Naira or US Dollars. Be sure to ask for evidence and proof of people benefitting daily from this. CLICK HERE TO START. ATTENTION NIGERIANS: You can now comfortably earn US Dollars when you acquire premium domains for as low as $3000 and profit $15,000-$35,000. Ideal for professionals like Entrepreneurs, Doctors, Civil/Public servants, IT Experts, Accountants ETC. CLICK HERE TO START. Stay in the know—fast. Get instant alerts, breaking headlines, and exclusive stories with the Punch News App . Download now and never miss a beat",
