   "summary": "The Chief of Army Staff (COAS), Lieutenant General Waidi Shaibu, has arrived in Kigali, Rwanda, for a working visit aimed at boosting bilateral military cooperation and advancing collective responses to security threats across Africa. The visit, scheduled for October 18 to 23, 2026, is at the invitation of the Rwanda Defence Force (RDF) Army Chief of Staff, Major General Vincent Nyakarundi.",
   "summary_zh": "陆军参谋长（COAS）瓦伊迪·沙伊布中将已抵达卢旺达基加利，进行旨在加强双边军事合作并推进非洲安全威胁集体应对的工作访问。此次访问定于2026年10月18日至23日，应卢旺达国防军（RDF）陆军参谋长文森特·尼亚卡伦迪少将邀请进行。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The Chief of Army Staff (COAS), Lieutenant General Waidi Shaibu, has arrived in Kigali, Rwanda, for a working visit aimed at boosting bilateral military cooperation and advancing collective responses to security threats across Africa. The visit, scheduled for October 18 to 23, 2026, is at the invitation of the Rwanda Defence Force (RDF) Army Chief of Staff, Major General Vincent Nyakarundi. Shaibu was received upon arrival by Nyakarundi alongside Nigeria’s Acting High Commissioner to Rwanda, Ambassador Ibrahim Zanna. Officials said the discussions are expected to focus on professional exchanges and practical ways the two forces can work together against common threats facing the continent, as further details of the engagements are expected in the coming days. Gilbert Ekugbe is a journalist at Punch Newspapers with over a decade of experience reporting on business and economic affairs. He covers markets, corporate developments, finance, and Nigeria’s broader economic landscape. His reporting is informed by extensive newsroom experience and a strong commitment to accuracy and responsible journalism, helping readers understand complex business issues. NEWS UPDATE: Nigerians can now earn as much as $15,000- $25,000 with premium domains. You decide if you want payment in Naira or US Dollars. Be sure to ask for evidence and proof of people benefitting daily from this. CLICK HERE TO START. ATTENTION NIGERIANS: You can now comfortably earn US Dollars when you acquire premium domains for as low as $3000 and profit $15,000-$35,000. Ideal for professionals like Entrepreneurs, Doctors, Civil/Public servants, IT Experts, Accountants ETC. CLICK HERE TO START. Stay in the know—fast. Get instant alerts, breaking headlines, and exclusive stories with the Punch News App . Download now and never miss a beat",
