   "ageDays": 0.07,
   "summary": "Real Madrid manager, José Mourinho, has told Yan Diomande he must improve his finishing if he is to realise his full potential at the club. As reported by Fabrizio Romano on Monday, speaking after the team’s victory against Sevilla on Sunday, Mourinho expressed satisfaction with the young winger’s overall contribution but identified a clear area for development. He has a lot to work on, and he has many things he needs to improve.",
   "summary_zh": "皇家马德里主教练何塞·穆里尼奥告诉Yan Diomande，如果他想在俱乐部实现全部潜力，就必须提高他的终结能力。据Fabrizio Romano周一报道，在周日球队战胜塞维利亚之后，穆里尼奥对这位年轻边锋的整体贡献表示满意，但指出了一个明确的发展领域。他有很多工作要做，他有很多需要改进的地方。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Real Madrid manager, José Mourinho, has told Yan Diomande he must improve his finishing if he is to realise his full potential at the club. As reported by Fabrizio Romano on Monday, speaking after the team’s victory against Sevilla on Sunday, Mourinho expressed satisfaction with the young winger’s overall contribution but identified a clear area for development. “I am very happy with Diomande. He has a lot to work on, and he has many things he needs to improve. He needs to work on his finishing,” Mourinho said. Diomande, the 19-year-old Ivory Coast international who joined Real Madrid from RB Leipzig in a high-value summer transfer, has shown promising movement and an ability to arrive in threatening areas. Mourinho believes those qualities provide a strong foundation, but insists greater composure and better decision-making in the final third are essential for the attacker to progress. Gilbert Ekugbe is a journalist at Punch Newspapers with over a decade of experience reporting on business and economic affairs. He covers markets, corporate developments, finance, and Nigeria’s broader economic landscape. His reporting is informed by extensive newsroom experience and a strong commitment to accuracy and responsible journalism, helping readers understand complex business issues. NEWS UPDATE: Nigerians can now earn as much as $15,000- $25,000 with premium domains. You decide if you want payment in Naira or US Dollars. Be sure to ask for evidence and proof of people benefitting daily from this. CLICK HERE TO START. ATTENTION NIGERIANS: You can now comfortably earn US Dollars when you acquire premium domains for as low as $3000 and profit $15,000-$35,000. Ideal for professionals like Entrepreneurs, Doctors, Civil/Public servants, IT Experts, Accountants ETC. CLICK HERE TO START. Stay in the know—fast. Get instant alerts, breaking headlines, and exclusive stories with the Punch News App . Download now and never miss a beat",
