   "title": "Last moments of Shettima Muhammad Kashim",
   "url": "https://dailytrust.com/last-moments-of-shettima-muhammad-kashim/",
   "domain": "dailytrust.com",
   "source": "Daily Trust（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Mon, 19 Oct 2026 06:42:09 +0000",
