   "summary": "The Minister of Works, Senator David Umahi, who led a Federal Government delegation to reopen the bridge on Thursday, formally said the swift completion of the repair works underscores President Bola Ahmed Tinubu’s commitment to preserving critical national infrastructure and ensuring the safety of Nigerians. Umahi, while addressing journalists at the bridgehead, said the closure became necessary to carry out comprehensive maintenance on the bridge.",
   "summary_zh": "周四率领联邦政府代表团重新开放该桥梁的工程部长 Senator David Umahi 正式表示，迅速完成修复工作凸显了总统 Bola Ahmed Tinubu 致力于保护关键国家基础设施并确保尼日利亚人安全的承诺。Umahi 在桥头向记者发表讲话时表示，关闭桥梁是为了对桥梁进行全面维护。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The Minister of Works, Senator David Umahi, who led a Federal Government delegation to reopen the bridge on Thursday, formally said the swift completion of the repair works underscores President Bola Ahmed Tinubu’s commitment to preserving critical national infrastructure and ensuring the safety of Nigerians. Umahi, while addressing journalists at the bridgehead, said the closure became necessary to carry out comprehensive maintenance on the bridge. Speaking at the reopening ceremony, Umahi praised President Bola Tinubu’s infrastructure interventions in South-South, urging residents of the regions to reciprocate by supporting his re-election bid in 2027. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates → Join Our WhatsApp Channel BREAKING NEWS: Nigerians can invest ₦2.5million on premium domains and earn about ₦17-25Million. Earnings in USD. Rather than wonder, click here to find out how it works --> --> LEADERSHIP News",
