   "summary": "The Chinese capital Beijing is expected to become \"super-aged\" by 2035, with around one-third of its population aged 60 and above, the official Beijing Daily reported.",
   "summary_zh": "官方《北京日报》报道，中国首都北京预计到 2035 年将成为“超级老龄化”社会，其约三分之一的人口年龄在 60 岁及以上。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The Chinese capital Beijing is expected to become \"super-aged\" by 2035, with around one-third of its population aged 60 and above, the official Beijing Daily reported. Chinese policymakers have made population planning a key part of the country's economic strategy, and this year the government faces a total potential cost of around 180 billion yuan ($26.92 billion) to boost births, according to Reuters estimates",
