   "summary": "Governor Makinde is the NGF’s incumbent Vice-Chairman. “The Presidency stated that NLNG had paid $21.5 billion in dividends into the Federation Account since inception, including $3 billion received under the current administration. What happened to the $3 billion received under this administration?”, he queried Olanrewaju stated that hovernor Makinde conducts public discourse with decorum and “Does not make unfounded claims or quote figures without a basis.",
   "summary_zh": "州长马金德是NGF现任副主席。“总统府表示，NLNG自成立以来已向联邦账户支付了215亿美元股息，其中包括在本届政府下收到的30亿美元。本届政府收到的30亿美元发生了什么？”，他质问奥兰雷瓦朱表示，州长马金德以礼仪进行公共讨论，并且“不会提出毫无根据的主张或在没有依据的情况下引用数字。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "According to him, the report remains in the custody of both the Federal Government and the NGF. “We trust the Presidency will not deny its existence. Governor Makinde is the NGF’s incumbent Vice-Chairman. “The Presidency stated that NLNG had paid $21.5 billion in dividends into the Federation Account since inception, including $3 billion received under the current administration. “Have states and local governments received their shares? How much did they receive, and how were those amounts calculated? What happened to the $3 billion received under this administration?”, he queried Olanrewaju stated that hovernor Makinde conducts public discourse with decorum and “Does not make unfounded claims or quote figures without a basis. “We remain ready to provide further clarification while we urge the presidency to address the substance of the matter”. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates → Join Our WhatsApp Channel BREAKING NEWS: Nigerians can invest ₦2.5million on premium domains and earn about ₦17-25Million. Earnings in USD. Rather than wonder, click here to find out how it works --> --> Adebayo Waheed Adebayo Waheed is a Senior Reporter with Leadership Newspaper, specialising in general news reporting and known for in-depth features and a consistent commitment to accurate and factual journalism",
