   "title": "N250b NLNG Fund: Publish The Dividend Receipts, Makinde-Daura Campaign Replies Presidency",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/n250b-nlng-fund-publish-the-dividend-receipts-makinde-daura-campaign-replies-presidency/",
