   "title": "Cardoso: We Would Stay the Course on Reforms to Sustain Investor Confidence",
   "url": "https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/10/18/cardoso-we-would-stay-the-course-on-reforms-to-sustain-investor-confidence",
   "domain": "thisdaylive.com",
