   "title": "Two quiet but important shifts in how Ghana is financing itself.",
   "url": "https://x.com/thecindyyy_/status/2111732605733274014",
   "snippet": "Two quiet but important shifts in how Ghana is financing itself. COCOBOD is raising money locally on the stock exchange to buy cocoa this season instead of leaning as heavily on external loans. At the same time, GoldBod has been selling hundreds of millions of dollars from gold operations into the banking system, giving banks more foreign exchange and offering the cedi some breathing room.\nNeither of these is magic. Farmers still need to be paid properly, and businesses still need dollars at reasonable rates. But they are examples of trying to manage with more of our own resources. The question for ordinary people is whether the stability reaches the market, the farmgate and the shop shelf.\n#SocietyAndDiplomacy",
